# BUGS

Only the first codec, and on it one playback and one capture path, are used; HDMI and DisplayPort codecs, digital pins and a second output are not.
Jacks are not sensed, so plugging headphones in moves nothing, and nothing is told.
The codec's own volume isn't served: `volume` has no amplifier lines.
The CIX Sky1's controller (`CIXH6020`) is not matched: the driver knows its word-only registers and DMA address window but not yet its clocks, its reset or its reserved DMA memory.
